                                "sense_id": "9e8bf71f-0899-3b6f-af81-a24ab482d4be",
                                "text": "Peckerwood a regional version of woodpecker, became first a slur used by poor southern black Americans to describe poor southern white Americans, then a self-descriptor and symbol proudly used by white racists."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
